{
  "id": "05644_houkokusuru",
  "headword": "{報告|ほうこく}する",
  "reading": "ほうこくする",
  "part_of_speech": "verb (suru)",
  "gloss": "to report",
  "definitions": [
    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "to report, to inform",
      "explanation": "To give a formal or official account of something to someone in authority."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "05644_houkokusuru_ex1",
      "japanese": "{結果|けっか}を{上司|じょうし}に{報告|ほうこく}した。",
      "english": "I reported the results to my boss.",
      "notes": null,
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "05644_houkokusuru_ex2",
      "japanese": "{進捗状況|しんちょくじょうきょう}を{報告|ほうこく}してください。",
      "english": "Please report on the progress status.",
      "notes": "Common in business settings",
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "05644_houkokusuru_ex3",
      "japanese": "{警察|けいさつ}に{事故|じこ}を{報告|ほうこく}しなければならない。",
      "english": "I must report the accident to the police.",
      "notes": null,
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "05644_houkokusuru_ex4",
      "japanese": "{会議|かいぎ}で{先月|せんげつ}の{売上|うりあげ}について{報告|ほうこく}した。",
      "english": "I reported on last month's sales at the meeting.",
      "notes": null,
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "05644_houkokusuru_ex5",
      "japanese": "{問題|もんだい}が{見|み}つかったらすぐに{報告|ほうこく}するように{言|い}われている。",
      "english": "I've been told to report immediately if any problems are found.",
      "notes": null,
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ]
    }
  ],
  "notes": "COMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {報告書|ほうこくしょ}: report (document)\n- {報告|ほうこく}を{受|う}ける: to receive a report\n- {中間報告|ちゅうかんほうこく}: interim report\n- {最終報告|さいしゅうほうこく}: final report\n\nBUSINESS USAGE:\nIn Japanese companies, {報告|ほうこく} is one of the three key workplace communication concepts: 報連相 (ほうれんそう) - {報告|ほうこく} (report), {連絡|れんらく} (contact), {相談|そうだん} (consult).",
